@base = http://localhost:5108

# Paste the token returned by /auth/login or /auth/register here
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

# Paste a trail id returned by GET /trails here
@trailId = YOUR_TRAIL_ID_HERE

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Readiness (requer Mentor ou Manager)
GET {{base}}/health/detailed
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Registro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@trail.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "role": 0
}

###

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@trail.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

###

### Login como Mentor
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mentor@trail.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

###

### Login como Manager
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@trail.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

###

### Meu perfil (requer token)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar trilhas (autenticado)
GET {{base}}/trails
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar trilhas com paginação e filtro (autenticado)
GET {{base}}/trails?page=1&pageSize=20&search=backend
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar desafios de uma trilha (autenticado)
GET {{base}}/trails/{{trailId}}/challenges
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
